  "contentHtml": "<p>경기도 수석교사님들이 좋은 연수를 만들어 주셨습니다.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>첨부 파일 열어보시고 </p><p>관심있는 주제에 참여해 보세요~</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DKIr%26dataid%3D649%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20150825105137&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile262.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F265ED74C55DBC9F9151BE0')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 제2회수업으로행복한교사운영계획서.hwp</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"line-height: 180%; text-indent: -45.1pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 45.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">참가 신청 유의사항</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 180%; text-indent: -10.5pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 10.5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">               </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">누구나 다 참가할 수 있으며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">각 강좌별 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">25</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명 선착순 마감합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 180%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">               </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모든 강좌와 교재는 무료이며</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수강신청은 9</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">금</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">까지 구글로 받습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 180%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">               </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수강신청 구글 주소 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">: <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>http://gg.gg/3t8f1</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 180%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">               </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수강 신청은 수강강좌 희망교를 선택하는 것으로 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교시와 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">강좌를 모두 수강하는 것입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">확정여부는 개인 문자로 개별공지 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}